    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 1.1.4:
  * MPRIS integration
  * Relax Pomodoro completion threshold from 80% to 75%
  * Relax completion threshold for long breaks
  * Determine session expiry timeout based on Pomodoro duration
  * Do not detect activity while on a lock-screen with &quot;Pause By Locking The Screen&quot; off
  * Fix activity detection after first break
  * Fix higher CPU usage when opening window in Stats view</comment>
    <requestid>1373325</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="3" vrev="1">
