    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 1.1.5:
  * Added a dialog for installing the GNOME Shell extension
  * Automation panel is now available in the Flatpak version
  * Added a right-click context menu in compact mode
  * Updated runtime to GNOME 51
  * Removed dependency on cairo</comment>
